{"page":169,"width":1942,"height":2844,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"4.4.5 실습 문제 9: 부분 정렬","words":[{"text":"4.4.5","x":236,"y":176,"width":122,"height":41},{"text":"실습","x":389,"y":169,"width":94,"height":51},{"text":"문제","x":499,"y":170,"width":93,"height":51},{"text":"9:","x":610,"y":173,"width":43,"height":44},{"text":"부분","x":672,"y":168,"width":93,"height":50},{"text":"정렬","x":782,"y":168,"width":89,"height":51}]},{"text":"앞서 연습 문제 19와 연습 문제 20에서는 벡터의 모든 원소를 오름치순(또는 내림치순)으로 전제","words":[{"text":"앞서","x":236,"y":302,"width":70,"height":39},{"text":"연습","x":327,"y":302,"width":73,"height":38},{"text":"문제","x":413,"y":302,"width":71,"height":39},{"text":"19와","x":503,"y":303,"width":79,"height":38},{"text":"연습","x":596,"y":302,"width":70,"height":38},{"text":"문제","x":679,"y":301,"width":69,"height":39},{"text":"20에서는","x":766,"y":301,"width":152,"height":40},{"text":"벡터의","x":932,"y":302,"width":104,"height":40},{"text":"모든","x":1054,"y":304,"width":74,"height":36},{"text":"원소를","x":1142,"y":302,"width":110,"height":39},{"text":"오름치순(또는","x":1265,"y":302,"width":239,"height":39},{"text":"내림치순)으로","x":1521,"y":302,"width":242,"height":39},{"text":"전제","x":1781,"y":307,"width":63,"height":43}]},{"text":"정릴히는 코드를 작성했습니다. 그러나 이러한 전체 정렬이 필요하지 않은 경우도 있습니다. 예를","words":[{"text":"정릴히는","x":236,"y":377,"width":150,"height":39},{"text":"코드를","x":397,"y":379,"width":113,"height":36},{"text":"작성했습니다.","x":521,"y":376,"width":226,"height":40},{"text":"그러나","x":765,"y":376,"width":110,"height":40},{"text":"이러한","x":888,"y":377,"width":109,"height":39},{"text":"전체","x":1010,"y":376,"width":67,"height":40},{"text":"정렬이","x":1095,"y":376,"width":104,"height":40},{"text":"필요하지","x":1218,"y":375,"width":141,"height":40},{"text":"않은","x":1378,"y":375,"width":75,"height":39},{"text":"경우도","x":1468,"y":376,"width":114,"height":39},{"text":"있습니다.","x":1599,"y":376,"width":159,"height":39},{"text":"예를","x":1779,"y":380,"width":69,"height":42}]},{"text":"들어 전 세계 모든 사람의 나이를 저장한 벡터가 있고, 이 중에서 나이가 많은 10% 사람들 중에서","words":[{"text":"들어","x":233,"y":452,"width":73,"height":39},{"text":"전","x":325,"y":453,"width":34,"height":37},{"text":"세계","x":373,"y":453,"width":71,"height":40},{"text":"모든","x":460,"y":455,"width":75,"height":36},{"text":"사람의","x":547,"y":453,"width":105,"height":40},{"text":"나이를","x":669,"y":453,"width":108,"height":39},{"text":"저장한","x":791,"y":453,"width":110,"height":40},{"text":"벡터가","x":913,"y":453,"width":108,"height":40},{"text":"있고,","x":1035,"y":453,"width":78,"height":40},{"text":"이","x":1132,"y":451,"width":31,"height":40},{"text":"중에서","x":1179,"y":450,"width":107,"height":40},{"text":"나이가","x":1304,"y":450,"width":112,"height":40},{"text":"많은","x":1429,"y":450,"width":77,"height":39},{"text":"10%","x":1522,"y":456,"width":74,"height":30},{"text":"사람들","x":1610,"y":451,"width":117,"height":38},{"text":"중에서","x":1739,"y":454,"width":104,"height":43}]},{"text":"중앙값을 찾아야 한다고 생각해보겠습니다.","words":[{"text":"중앙값을","x":233,"y":527,"width":153,"height":39},{"text":"찾아야","x":398,"y":528,"width":113,"height":40},{"text":"한다고","x":522,"y":529,"width":109,"height":39},{"text":"생각해보겠습니다.","x":644,"y":528,"width":298,"height":40}]},{"text":"직관적인 방법은 전체 나이를 정렬하여 상위 10%만 추출하고, 이 중에서 중앙값을 찾으면 됩니","words":[{"text":"직관적인","x":237,"y":621,"width":148,"height":39},{"text":"방법은","x":403,"y":623,"width":112,"height":39},{"text":"전체","x":531,"y":624,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"나이를","x":619,"y":623,"width":108,"height":39},{"text":"정렬하여","x":743,"y":623,"width":139,"height":40},{"text":"상위","x":901,"y":622,"width":70,"height":40},{"text":"10%만","x":992,"y":621,"width":106,"height":38},{"text":"추출하고,","x":1112,"y":620,"width":155,"height":41},{"text":"이","x":1290,"y":620,"width":32,"height":39},{"text":"중에서","x":1341,"y":620,"width":110,"height":39},{"text":"중앙값을","x":1472,"y":619,"width":157,"height":40},{"text":"찾으면","x":1646,"y":620,"width":113,"height":38},{"text":"됩니","x":1778,"y":622,"width":64,"height":42}]},{"text":"다. 그러나 이 방법은 원하는 답